county"],["ARC or PLC in Merrimack County","/arc-plc/new-hampshire/merrimack-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids May to June came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, July to August came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June stands at 138% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1965, with grid 27834 at 63% of normal that year.</p>"}
